; The one variable: clip_text on a box narrower than its label. CheckBox, CheckButton, OptionButton
; and MenuButton draw their label through Button::_notification, so TextParagraph::draw cuts each
; line to the paragraph box (text_paragraph.cpp:925-931) and clip_text zeroes the text's width in the
; minimum size (button.cpp:493-495). Each box is narrower than "alpha bravo" plus its icon.

